WEBVTT

00:18:58.476 --> 00:19:00.036
whereas previously in history,

00:19:00.076 --> 00:19:02.396
this was, you know,
the basic stuff of history.

00:19:02.436 --> 00:19:04.076
Since 1945,

00:19:04.076 --> 00:19:07.636
not a single internationally
recognized country

00:19:07.676 --> 00:19:10.836
was wiped off the map
by external invasion.

00:19:11.156 --> 00:19:14.036
This was the common thing in history.

00:19:14.756 --> 00:19:16.916
Until then and then it stopped.

00:19:16.956 --> 00:19:19.436
This is an amazing achievement,

00:19:19.476 --> 00:19:21.876
which is the basis for everything we have,

00:19:21.876 --> 00:19:23.516
for our medical services,

00:19:23.556 --> 00:19:25.516
for education system,

00:19:25.556 --> 00:19:28.316
and this is all now in jeopardy.

00:19:28.356 --> 00:19:30.516
Because this era of peace,